window.products.push({"id":251067,"name":"AEIDDRWAA 1.0L Beer Stein with Matel Pewter Lid Bavaria Steel Germany Oktoberfest Tankard Eagle Bierkrug Drinking Glass Horn Coffee Mug Stine Christma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OSlQ74T0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The October Oktoberfest is the most famous carnival. Beer mugs are indispensable Wine drinkware and collections, and are the best choice for American beer lovers for gifts The German beer mug is very popular in Bavaria, Germany, so it is also called the Bavarian Stein. In the middle of the 16th century, Germany clearly stipulated that food and beverage utensils must be stamped. Of course, beer glasses are also included, so the beer glasses of this period are all with lids, often attached to a tin pewter top lid. There is also a thumb button on the edge of the lid so that the user can open the lid while holding the beer glass, and once the button is released, the beer glass will be covered, which also directly avoids the entry of germs in the air. Until now, the lid is also a kind of decoration,continuing today. There are German beer steins made of porcelain, glass, and stoneware. The most popular are the character steins. Unfortunately, America has become the largest market for beer and subsequently the manufacturing of beer steins. While production of German beer steins is still present, it may never recover from this American on slaught. Please Note: These ceramic beer Mugs are handmade and hand painted so there may be a slight variance in shape and colour. Product Features: Material: Handmade and hand painted ceramic Hand wash only Pack Contains: 1X Beer Stein The sponge wraps the whole Stein, and there is a color box outside","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OSlQ74T0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AEIDDRWAA","source_asin":"B091BZ1X7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BZ1X7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BZ1X7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251068,"name":"JOLLYVOGUE King Size Weighted Blanket 25 lbs-88''x104'' for Adult with Premium Fabric and Glass Beads, Dark Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7155XK8DItL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRUE KING SIZE WEIGHTED BLANKET--Our large blanket is 88''x104\". Some of the so-called \"king size\" blankets are actually much smaller, it wasn't big enough to hang off the edges of the queen or king bed like a bedspread--ours does! JOLLYVOGUE king size weighted blanket also can be shared with two people, real couple weighted blanket INNOVATIVE 7 LAYER DESIGN--Our heavy blanket adopts a 7-layer design, a smaller inner bag, and exquisite craftsmanship standards. This adult weighted blanket includes two extra breathable cotton layers between the utmost premium fabric and non-glue polyester padding. Double stitching was sewed with an elegant quilting pattern, which made the square pocket much smaller (4\"x4\") to avoid glass beads leaking to distribute weight more evenly SUPPORTED BY SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH--7%-12% of their body weight will be the most comfortable. The deep pressure of the blanket makes you feel like being hugged or wrapped, which can help you relieve. TIPS: Start by choosing the right size for your bed (king, queen, full, twin). Next, choose the weight of a blanket based on the amount of stress you want to experience. For blankets of the same weight, the larger the size of the blanket, the smaller the pressure the human body feels A PERFECT GIFT CHOICE--Best weighted blanket is sewed with reinforced stitching and 8 loops (keep it in place inside the cover). With a classic and elegant design at the edge of the blanket, doubling as a throw blanket, our soft cotton weighted blanket also forms part of your home decor! Used not only on the bed but on the couch, chair, anywhere you want for anything. Can be given as a gift to a friend, relative, or yourself RISK-FREE PURCHASE--Complete customer satisfaction is our top priority! It is also the driving force of our continuous improvement. If you have any questions about our products, please do not hesitate to contact us, we will spare no effort to assist you to solve any problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7155XK8DItL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOLLYVOGUE","source_asin":"B0BNNRYQDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNRYQDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNRYQDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
