window.products.push({"id":251139,"name":"FINE LECHO Soft Luxurious 1-Piece Pinch Pleated Pintuck Decorative Quilt Duvet Cover Egyptian Cotton 800 Thread Count Comforter Cover (Twin/Twin XL, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H5+AJce3L._AC_SL1441_.jpg","description":"ARE YOU LOOKING TO SPICE UP YOUR BEDROOM? This 1 Piece Pinch Pleated Duvet Cover is your answer. Fashion meets luxury with this set and is the perfect solution to your decorative and comfort needs. ABOUT US: Add fashion and style to your home with our FINE LECHO latest range of bed sheets, comforters, duvet set, wrap around bedskirt, split and waterbed sheet set, reversible duvet set available in both pattern solid & stripe, You can buy combination products in one listing like Sheets set with duvet set, duvet set with fitted sheet and duvet set with flat sheet. Redefine the Way you dress up your rooms with FINE LECHO beautiful colors like aqua blue, black, burgundy, blood red, brick red, chocolate, royal blue, elephant grey, gold, hot pink, ivory, lilac, lavender, navy blue, olive, parrot green, peach, pink, purple, sage, silver grey, sky blue, taupe, white, wine, orange, turquoise blue, and yellow. You can make your home more stylish with our collection of premium bed sheets. Our collection is designed to make you feel special in luxurious way. Enhance your home with FINE LECHO bedding collection, made with a touch of class. MAKE YOUR BEDROOM LOOK AWESOME: Update the look of your bedroom with this soft, fashionable bedding set. Designed with a pinch pleat pattern, this duvet cover set is fully machine washable and comes with matching decorative shams to brighten any room. FULLY FASHIONED: You'll love the soft comfort of this Duvet Cover set. The visibly plump stuffing is crafted of a hypoallergenic down substitute, and the Set is fashioned in two harmonious solid shades for turn-down contrast. PERFECT FIT: Two matching shams keep your pillows in place. Compartment stitching prevents bunching when you wash the Set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H5+AJce3L._AC_SL1441_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINE LECHO","source_asin":"B07798ZFPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07798ZFPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07798ZFPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251140,"name":"Westmark 11302260 V Blade Mandoline Slicer, 5 in 1 Multifunctional Mandoline Slicer with Stainless Steel V Blade for Fruits, Vegetables and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Th6JBM-RL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"11302260 make everyday food prep faster, easier and safer than ever with this user friendly Mandoline which ensures safe slicing. Call this slicer a Mandoline food slicer, Mandoline slicer, fruit slicer, vegetable slicer, cutting tool, easy slicer, veggie slicer, slice and dice, banana slicer, cheese slicer or tomato slicer, the point is this tool gets the job done. Features: -material: ABS and stainless steel.-Professional one.-Slicer with 5 different inserts.-Food holder for safe work included.-Very easy handling and cleaning. Dimensions:.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Th6JBM-RL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westmark","source_asin":"B00C9OACXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C9OACXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C9OACXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251141,"name":"Victorinox Forged 6-Inch Wide Utility Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":158.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21p6W5Cbb0L._AC_.jpg","description":"From the inventors of the famous Swiss Army knife comes a line of fine cutlery designed for accomplished and aspiring chefs at work or in the home. The Forged line gets its name from the construction of the knives' blades, which are hot-drop forged in Germany from high-carbon stainless steel. High-carbon steel provides maximum sharpness and edge retention. The knives are finished in Switzerland and ice tempered to sustain sharpness longer, even after resharpening. They feature a single-piece full-tang construction for stability and balance, as well as bolsterless edges for use of their entire blades and ease of sharpening. Triple-riveted for durability and ergonomically designed to provide optimum weight, balance, and comfort, the Plastic-Over-Molded (POM) handles will hold their shape and not crack or separate from blades. The Victorinox Forged collection is an extensive range with open-stock pieces as well as handy and versatile sets. A great alternative to the larger chef's knife, the 6-inch-wide utility knife will slice through small pieces of meat, vegetables, or fruit. It makes a great gift for the home chef who already has everything else, or anyone looking to round out a collection. All Forged cutlery should be washed by hand for best care, and Victorinox covers each piece with a lifetime warranty against manufacturer defects. From the Manufacturer View larger. Who is Victorinox? Although Victorinox is known the world over as the creator of the Original Swiss Army Knife, the company started out in 1884 as a cutlery workshop. By the time company creator Karl Elsener delivered his first pocket knife to the Swiss Army, his cutlery business was already booming. Over the next century, Victorinox cutlery became a top-rated choice among professionals worldwide, with over 300 blades to offer. Victorinox knives have regularly appeared as highly ranked and recommended kitchen tools in Cook’s Illustrated , Men’s Health , The Cincinnati Enquirer , New York Magazine , and Natural Health , just to name a few. In 2009, the company announced a partnership with professional chef, Daniel Humm, of Eleven Madison Park in New York City. In addition, building on the success of its cutlery business, Victorinox has brought all the same quality and expertise to a wider range of products and accessories, including other kitchen tools, pocket tools, watches, luggage, and clothing. What is a forged blade? Forging is the process by which metal is transformed into a knife’s shape. A forged knife requires more metal to make it, so it’s usually heavier and thicker than a stamped knife and, in many cases, is considered the stronger and superior blade. Forged knives usually have a steel bolster at the beginning of the handle and a tang that runs through the handle’s center. All Victorinox forged cutlery is hot-drop forged, which is a high-quality, time-tested method of manufacturing. Steel is super heated and placed under a multi-ton forging hammer, where it is hammered into the shape of the die. The hot metal is placed on the bottom part of the die and the top part of the die drops onto it with great force, causing the metal to spread into the shape of the die. This is only the first of many steps required by expert craftsmen. Additional processing, tempering, grinding, heat treating, polishing, and more, are the reasons why forged knives cost a bit more. Much more effort goes into their creation than in the creation of stamped blades. What knives do I need to own? Knife choice or selection is determined by many factors--size, function, style, and preference. The most important factor is function. Different knives have different uses. It is important to use the proper knife for a specific task, since proper knife selection and the use of a proper-sized, sharp knife make for safe cutting. General kitchen tasks and the knife to use for them are as follows: Paring: The most common to own and use, a paring knife is generally for small cutting jobs and peeling of vegetables or fruit. The blade size is usually from three to four inches. Choose the shape and size to fit your hand. Since this is one of the more versatile knives, owning more than one is recommended. Chef's: The most important tool and essential to every cook, a chef‘s knife is most often used in a rocking method to mince, dice, and chop vegetables and herbs. This one is known as the chef’s best friend. Slicer: Most commonly used to slice meats, poultry, and seafood, the slicer is an important companion to any host or hostess. Boning: As its name suggests, a boning knife is used to trim or remove meat and fish from the bone. Bread: Designed with a special edge, a bread knife makes easy work of cutting through crusty bread, pastries, or any item with a crust and a soft interior. Fillet: Most often used by pros and seasoned home chefs, the fillet knife is used to fillet meat and fish. Cleaver: An important addition to any collection, a cleaver is often used to cut or chop thro","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21p6W5Cbb0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B0017K2RO4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0017K2RO4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0017K2RO4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
