window.products.push({"id":251194,"name":"Scott Living Terrain Charcoal Cotton Blend Solid 6-Piece Towel Set | Bombay Brown | Super Soft & Quick Drying | Designer Home Towels | Sustainable | 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hBdy6W0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in an 88% cotton, 12% charcoal polyester blended bath towel. Highly absorbent, made to last, these 450 GSM weight towels dry quickly, maintain both strength and durability even after multiple washes. Choose from multiple color options in white, tan, gray, yellow, brown or blue to coordinate with any bathroom decor, kids bath or guest bathroom. This six piece set includes: 2 Bath Towels (30” x 54”) each, 2 Hand Towels (16” x 30”) each. Two Wash Cloths (13” x 13”) each. MUST HAVE FEATURES, Our contemporary bath towels are constructed for everyday performance with activated charcoal infused yarns. This spun in technology allows fibers to fight off odor to remain fresh for the life of the towel. Wrap up in a sculpted, zero-twist, popcorn texture with clean edges for a tailored look in the right amount of warmth and softness. Clean lines, quality materials and easy care deliver a designer bathroom towel set for you, family or guest. CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living home products are better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. Our cotton blended textiles feature sustainably sourced fibers that are environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable. EASY CARE, Wash before use. Machine wash warm with like colors. Gentle cycle. Use non-chlorine bleach when needed. Avoid use of fabric softener. Tumble dry low. Do not iron. Do not dry clean. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with the coordinating Scott Living Terrain Charcoal Cotton Bath Rug. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hBdy6W0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09NLZJ7KH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NLZJ7KH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NLZJ7KH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
