window.products.push({"id":251199,"name":"HDCAXKJ Sectional Couch Covers for Dogs 3-Pieces Water Resistant L Shape Sofa Cover Set Pet Friendly Sectional Slipcovers Living Room Non Slip L-Shape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MQsHl+0+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Water Resistant: Adopting the latest water-repellent technology, our sectional couch covers l shape will resist accidentally spilled water in daily life, also protect the sofa from dogs hairs, cats scratching, kids mess, stains, wear and tear. but please note that in order to preserve the softness of fabric furniture covers, it's NOT 100% waterproof like a plastic slip cover. Water drops on the l shape couch cover will form water droplets that need to be wiped off immediately 3-Pieces Design: This Upgraded sectional sofa cover includes 1 backrest cover, 1 seat cover and 1 chaise cover. Compared to traditional one-piece couch covers for sectional sofa l shape, our separated covers design sectional slipcovers is more fit after installation, and suitable for different kinds of sofas, such as sectional sofa with left chaise or right chaise, corner sofas. There are 3 sizes for choose: small, Large and XL Large. Please find the Measuring Guide in photos Stay in Place: Anti-slip design makes you no need to tidy up the sectional cover all the time. Firstly, the reverse side has non-slip silicon dots that keep the l shape sofa cover from shifting around. Secondly, the l shaped couch cover comes with foam sticks to be inserted into the seat cushion gaps to keep the couch slipcover stay in place. Thirdly, there is detachable and adjustable strap on the backrest cover to prevent it from slipping off. Works for both leather and cloth sofa High Quality: Thick and durable 3 layers diamond-shaped quilted sectional couch cover design. This premium furniture protector is made of 100% brushed microfiber polyester fabric on the surface, filled with down alternative fiber batting for ultimate comfort and durability, and features with slip-resistant silicon dots backing. It's a soft and comfortable, breathable and skin friendly sofa slipcovers for living room, great for homes with pets and children Easy Install and Easy Care: This pet couch cover l shape is very simple to install in 1 minute, please find the installation guide of couch protector in photos. Easy to care: Machine washable in cold water on the gentle cycle, do not use bleach, line dry. Our belief is that quality speaks louder than anything! We provide 24*7 friendly customer support and also back our protective sofa covers for sectional sofa set for 18 months, try it with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MQsHl+0+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HDCAXKJ","source_asin":"B08GLPBPLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GLPBPLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GLPBPLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
