window.products.push({"id":251372,"name":"Digital Kitchen Scale, PLEMO Multifunctional Food Scale with Stainless Steel Bowl, Alarm Timer & Temperature Sensor, 5 kg / 11 lb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EuAfi6NgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This PLEMO KS-B5 electronic food scale is an indispensable gadget for precise weighing in your kitchen. The premium strain gauge sensors ensure high accuracy with a resolution of 0.01 oz / 1 g. It stands out with a built-in surrounding temperature sensor and alarm timer. High Accuracy and Large Capacity for Your Convenience With a high resolution of 0.01 oz / 1 g, this scale accurately and precisely weighs any usual ingredients or food from 2 g to 5 kg (0.07 oz - 11 lb), such as sugar, flour, milk, fruits, vegetables, etc.  With a large LCD backlit display, it’s easy to read even when ambient light is insufficient. Low consumption and environmentally friendly batteries are included. Enjoy worry-free use for the long lifetime of this product. Multifunctional Design to Meet More Kitchen Needs This product not only functions as a scale, but also comes with a built-in surrounding temperature sensor and alarm timer.  Current temperature is displayed on the top right corner of the LCD screen with a range of 0℃ - 40℃. You can easily have an idea of the surrounding temperature to help you keep your food at the best state.  The alarm timer is nicely designed to display count down time while you’re cooking. Don’t worry about scorched food, burned meat, or an overcooked meal from now on! Notes 1. Weighing unit g will switch to kg if weighted item exceeds 1 kg; likewise, oz. will switch to lb. if weighted item exceeds 16 oz. 2. The scale weighs items of 2 g - 5 kg (0.07 oz - 11 lb) and the minimum resolution is 0.01 oz / 1 g. Therefore, the scale cannot separately weigh an item lighter than 2 g / 0.07 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EuAfi6NgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plemo","source_asin":"B01G1EJTHI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G1EJTHI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G1EJTHI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251373,"name":"Kraus KDM 10CB Kore Self Draining Silicone Dish Drying Mat or Trivet for Kitchen Counter, Universal Size, Cyan Blue (L)14 3/4inch x (W)8 1/8inch x (H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fiV--IxKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Protect your kitchen counters while drying your dishes with the KRAUS Self-Draining Silicone Dish Drying Mat. The smart design incorporates sloped drainage grooves that channel water directly into the sink, protecting your kitchen counters from water damage. Raised silicone ridges increase air circulation, allowing wet items to dry more quickly. Made with durable BPA-free silicone, this 100% food-safe mat is flexible enough to bend without breaking and easily stands up to everyday use. A non-slip design keeps it from sliding on the counter and prevents items from slipping, with an optimized angle engineered to prevent fragile stemware from tipping over. Heat-resistant up to 400°F for use as a trivet or coaster to protect your countertops from hot items, or as a cooling rack for baked goods straight out of the oven. Use this multi-functional accessory in the kitchen to air-dry pots, pans, and cutlery, or in the bathroom to protect your vanity countertops from cosmetics and hot hair styling tools. Waterproof construction allows you to simply wipe spills from the mats surface, or throw it into the dishwasher for easy cleaning. The color-stable stain-resistant material will not fade over time, with multiple color options available to complement your kitchen or bathroom sink. Perfect for smaller kitchens or prep areas with limited counter space, the compact design fits into any drawer or cabinet for convenient storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fiV--IxKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artist Unknown","source_asin":"B09NRXHQRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NRXHQRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NRXHQRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
