window.products.push({"id":251701,"name":"Curtain double rod: Ø 0.8 inch without rings, lenght 124.8 inch, satin steel finish – complete","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hbTdvTPbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This curtain rod, from the InCasa Collection and designed by Italian architects, has a diameter of 0.8 inch and double ceiling mounts of 2 inch. Both the rod and the mounts are finished in satin steel, and the rod can be mounted on ceiling.  If the ceiling, where the supports are mounted is plasterboard or otherwise brittle, please ask for special anchors. This kind of curtain rod without rings is suitable for curtains with eyelet rings and loop curtains. Pole and supplies very resistant, made to last in time. The rod only needs an occasional light dusting to remain clean.  Each measure is combined with various possibilities of mounts and finials (see all items ‘InCasa’ in amazon.com).  The length of the rod can be shortened prior to shipment, free of charge, by the manufacturer upon request.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hbTdvTPbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InCasa","source_asin":"B01EJV2TK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EJV2TK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EJV2TK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251702,"name":"SIEMOO 3D Frameless DIY Wall Clock, Large Wall Clock Kit 3D Mirror Number Stickers Mute Clock Modern Design for Home Living Room Bedroom Office Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61An49bM0eL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","description":"Warm Tips: 1. The wall clock stickers numbers and hands have a protective film, please tear it off after installation. 2. Please hang the clock on the wall, wait for 10~30 minutes to check the minute hand move well. Specifications : Size: the DIY clock size is adjustable as you like （100cm / 39.37”-120cm / 45.24”） Material: EVA foam stickers,acrylic,alloy clock face Hour hand: 31cm /12\" Minute hand: 39cm / 15.3\" Clock machine: 12cm/ 4.72\" Time accuracy: -0.8~+1.2second/day Power: 1*AA battery (not included) Clock color: Gold, Silver, Black Package Included: 1 x DIY Wall Clock Kit (without Battery). 1x Instruction Instruction: Step1 :Use a hammer to knock the nail into wall,then hang clock tray on the wall Step2 :Hang the paper scale on the clock tray, according to the scale to mark numbers’ position Step3 : Remove the paper from back of acrylic mirrors,then fit with matching EVA Step4 : Remove the back paper of EVA;stick to the wall Step5 :Tear off the protective films from mirrors Step6 :Fix the hour hand and minute hand one by one along the 12 o’clock position Step7 :Tighten the nut Step8 :Install a carbon AA battery for clock,adjust the time with gear button of quartz Step9 :Hanging the clock return to wall.Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61An49bM0eL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIEMOO","source_asin":"B07V8DG8ZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V8DG8ZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V8DG8ZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
