window.products.push({"id":251749,"name":"MVNIHEK Fridge Organizer and Storage Clear Set of 7, Stackable Various Sizes Refrigerator Organizer Bins with Lids, Produce Fruit Saver Containers Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710EaVFPbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FRIDGE ORGANIZER OF VARIOUS SIZES】The fridge organization set includes 7 bins of different sizes: Large x 1 (11.8*8*3.9 inches, 193oz), Medium x 2 (10.5*3.6*3.4 inches, 51oz), Small x 4 (4.9*3*2.8 inches, 16oz). The multi-sized refridgerator/freezer organization can store eggs, apples, asparagus and other vegetables and fruits of various sizes. 【CLEAR VISUAL DESIGN】These produce saver containers for refrigerator are made of PET material, they are environmentally friendly and BPA free. The PET fridge organizer has enough rigidity, so you don't have to worry about it twisting even if it is fully loaded. The clear visual fridge organization makes it easy to see and quickly find your food. 【WITH LID & STACKABLE】The fridge storage containers has a lid with a snap, but please note that it is not completely airtight, it reserves air permeability for the vegetables, preventing them from rotting and keeping them longer. These refrigerator organizer bins are regular in shape and very sturdy enough to be stacked. 【MULTI-SCENE USE】These produce saver containers for refrigerator can organize vegetables, fruits, berry, drink cans, eggs in the refrigerator. Fridge organization in multiple sizes are also the perfect counter and cabinet organizer to organize cereals, snacks in the kitchen, RV, pantry. The large-capacity fruit and vegetable storage is also a good helper for camping. 【QUALITY GUARANTEE】These refrigerator organizer bins are very easy to clean, just rinse with water, try not to use the dishwasher. Reusable clear fridge organizers and storage are your economical and sensible choice. If you have any questions about these fridge organizer bins please contact us and we will surely give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710EaVFPbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MVNIHEK","source_asin":"B0BDLD8KZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDLD8KZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDLD8KZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
