window.products.push({"id":251784,"name":"PROUS Space Heater, 1500W Silent Electric Heater With 3 Modes, Tip-Over and Overheat Protection, 70° Oscillating Portable Ceramic Heater for Home, Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P0NsVmkIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2s Fast Heating & 3 Modes】The powerful 1500W PTC ceramic technology enables this compact heater emit warm air in short 2 seconds. Equipped with 3 settings (High, Low, Fan only mode) for maximum comfort in every way. 【Multiple Protections】The last thing you want is a fire in your home due to a ceramic heater overheating. Our small portable heater are made from V0 flame retardant material and come with a host of safety features including tip-over and overheat protection. Safe for all day use. 【Quiet Heating】 40dB - almost as quiet as a library. The fan wheel uses oblique airflow technology, which effectively reduces wind noise and makes the room heater 12% quieter than traditional electric heaters. Calm airflow lets you sleep soundly and work undisturbed during the cold winter 【Uniform Heating】The exclusive trackball system helps create smooth and quiet oscillation. The 70° wide-angle oscillation, with a lifespan of over 750,000 cycles, boosts heating coverage by 20%, which helps distribute the warm air more evenly towards the room's corners 【Compact & Portable Design】The adjustable knobs are located on the top of the heater for easier control. The compact 11 inches design makes our space heaters a real space saver and the hidden handle makes it easy to carry from room to room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P0NsVmkIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prous","source_asin":"B0B7J2GNTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7J2GNTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7J2GNTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251785,"name":"OTOTO Tea Sub Tea Steeper- Cute Tea Infuser for Loose Tea- Silicone Tea Infuser- Yellow Submarine Tea Holder, Loose Leaf- Tea Infusers For Loose Tea, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nGTivy9fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Under The Tea - Hectic day? It’s tea time! Escape from your worries with a quick pop underwater in a yellow submarine. Relax and let your daydreams come to life with the OTOTO Tea Sub, a cute tea infuser that can transport you into another world with every cup. This charming tea steeper is designed by the multi awarded OTOTO Studio, the name behind many other whimsical favorites, like Al Dente, Red the Crab, and the Nessie Family. Quirky and Full of Personality - Tea Sub is such a charmer. A functional item with a fantastical twist, this tea steeper is a thoughtful present for every tea lover. If you’re looking for a gift that’s quirky and unique, without a doubt, Tea Sub is a great pick. Indeed, this cute kitchen gadget is perfect for any occasion, only from the brand that loves imagination. Safe and High Quali-tea — A functional gadget that’s top quality, this silicone tea infuser keeps you worry-free. Made from 100% food-safe materials and BPA-free, using Tea Sub is as easy as 1-2-3! 1) Open the cap, stuff it with loose tea leaves, then close. 2) Dip Tea Sub into a cup of hot water. 3) Wait a few minutes, and voila! Perfect brew for you! Adorable Functionality - The little windows on our submarine loose tea infuser are adorably cute yet functional. They make sure loose tea leaves remain inside, while hot liquid seeps through the entire ride. Brewing tea has never been this clever. With Tea Sub, your tea time is an experience to remember! A Sprinkle of fun- Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products. Why? Because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nGTivy9fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B0C3RG9TY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3RG9TY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3RG9TY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
