window.products.push({"id":251794,"name":"ORIA Digital Pocket Scale, Digital Milligram Scale, 0.001g/ 20g Mini Jewelry Weigh Scales with Calibration Weights Tweezers, Weighing Pans, LCD Displa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X3Y9H9kkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-precision Sensor】20g capacity, thousandth of a gram accuracy (0.001g), the digital milligram scale adopts a high-precision sensor system, if you wanna weigh jewelry or need exact weight, our scale is your best choice. 【Multiple Weight Units & Tare Function】 Large LCD display with blue backlight for easy reading in 6 units: g / oz / ozt / dwt / ct / gn. No worry about single unit, here you have different unit to meet your needs. The digital pocket scale has a tare function for items that are difficult to weigh and need to be placed in a container or need to be stacked. Simply place the container or tray on the scale, press the tare function, and place the item in the container/tray for an accurate reading. 【Easy To Use & Calibrate】This digital jewelry scale has a horizontal column and four corner pads, which can let you clearly know whether the scale is on a level surface, so as to make the measurement more accurate. If you notice any inaccuracies with your scale throughout use, simply use the included 20g calibration weight and recalibrate following the calibration method, and you can continue to use your scale accurately. 【Multifunctional】This mini digital scale is perfect for powder, gold or jewelry weighing or other small items weighing. The compact design also allows it to be used as a laboratory scale, jewelry scale, diamond scale and carat scale. 【Heartwarming Reminder】If there are any problems with the use or function of the product, or if the product is defective/damaged, please contact the seller first, we will do our best to solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X3Y9H9kkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIA","source_asin":"B0B593ZTR1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B593ZTR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B593ZTR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":251795,"name":"Eruner 16-inch Vintage Wood Wall Clock - France ParisCafe des Marguerites Country Retro Style Non-Ticking Silent Wooden Wall Clock (#09, 16\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nzbQ1EKNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Eruner Vintage Wood Wall Clock - France Paris Colourful Tuscan Style Quartz Movement #12888 Non-Ticking Silent Round/Nice/Cute Wooden Wall Clock Decorate your house with the Vintage French Tuscan Style clock, enjoy a colourful vintage moment anytime. This wood clock can be a good gift at housewarmings, weddings, and social gatherings. Perfect for Hanging in living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, cafe, restaurant, bar or hotel decor ect. Attention: 1. Wall clock is operated by 1 AA Carbon Zinc or Heavy Duty battery, while the current of alkaline battery is too big and easy to damage the movement and accuracy. 2. Due to the batteries is limited by international transport, the battery is not contained in the package 3. After you put the battery into the clock, make sure the screw on the minute hand wont be too tight. Because the wheel gear of Quartz won't be moving normally if it's too tight. 4. It might be slight difference between the product picture and the real clock caused by light brightness. Specifications: ROMANTIC STYLE: French Country Romantic Tuscan Style, Opposite & unity style, combine with shiny, dark, gorgeous, plain, glossy and rough diversified design  MOVEMENT: Quartz Movement #12888, the service life of quartz is 3-4 times longer than the ordinary batteries. MATERIAL: Wooden MDF, covered by top-grade waterproof coated paper with pattern film printing stickers, which is anti-oxidation, durable and vivid color without fastness DESIGN: Different sizes of clocks specially design for your specific decoration: such as 12\" is suitable for bedroom, kitchen, study; 14\"/16\"--Living room, bedroom, study, office; 18\"/23\"--hotel, cafe, bar, restaurant. SIZE: 12\"(30cm), 14\"(35cm), 16\"(40cm), 18\"(45cm), 23\"(58cm); Thickness: 5mm Package: 1*Eruner Vintage Wood Wall Clock&1 pcs hook","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nzbQ1EKNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eruner","source_asin":"B0140Q0PBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0140Q0PBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0140Q0PBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
