window.products.push({"id":251937,"name":"CHOSHOME Cooling Pillow Cases Standard, Double-Side Design [Cooling & Cotton] Q-Max 0.45 Cooling Pillow Covers for Night Sweats Hot Sleepers, Hidden Z","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q8+ZkwiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【MULTIL-USE DOUBLE-SIDED DESIGN 】This double-sided pillow cases are perfect for all seasons. One side is made with unique cooling sensing technology fabric that’ll feel cool and silky, perfect for hot summer; while the other side is 100% cotton fabric, comfortable and soft, great for spring, autumn and winter, help you relax and sleep better every night. Breathable and comfortable material will never leave you sweaty or overheated 💦【COOLING MATERIAL】This cooling pillow covers is made of revolutionary Q-Max > 0.4 Japanese Arc-Chill cooling fabric which is a natural cool material. The larger the Q-max value, the more heat the fabric takes away. This cooling material will naturally absorb heat and humidity to transfer away from your body, accelerate moisture evaporation and reduce skin temperature by 2 to 4 ℃, leave you an uninterrupted sound sleep, especially help for hot sleepers to combat night sweats and insomnia 💦【SKIN FRIENDLY & ANTI-STATIC】The special cooling fibers material is tight-weave, to make this pillow case naturally anti-static. Moreover, the smooth surface allows the skin and hair to slide over the cool pillowcase very gently and freely that help to reduce facial wrinkles and hair dry or knotted, protect your skin and hair health 💦【HIDDENN ZIPPER DESIGN】CHOSHOME cooling pillowcases with hidden zipper design which ensures to keep bed pillows perfectly inside the cover without making it slip out when it comes in contact with your head. Our durable zipper lasts a long time. Also, this cooling pillow covers with zipper are easy to remove and clean. They are both hand washable and machine washable, dry quickly and stay fresh 💦【PERFECT BEDDING CHOICE】There are 2 pack standard size (20\" x 26\") gray cooling pillowcases included in each of package. You can give this cold pillow cover as a unique gift to your dad, mom, wife, husband, or friends, let them feel excellent coolness and softness in the hot summer day. Please Note That There is No Kind of Fabric Can Keep a Long-lasting Cooling. We Recommend to Use These Pillowcases With the Air Conditioning Or an Fan for a Better Sleep Experience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q8+ZkwiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHOSHOME","source_asin":"B0B75178W1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-251937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B75178W1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B75178W1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
